  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Wedding Sparklers Now is a modern company that provides sparklers that can be used for all events. Our products are made of flawless double-coating achieved through a meticulous process using brighter sparks in gold. We came up with the idea of selling sparklers since they have a unique way of adding a different atmosphere and a magical spirit to any occasion. It's very versatile and may be used for weddings, birthdays, bridal showers, and other special occasions.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Our sparklers are known to create a radiant glow, resulting in enchanting and unforgettable moments. These sparklers are designed with elegance and uniqueness in mind to truly captivate every celebrant and their guests!</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-stringify-type=\"bold\">Premium Quality:</strong>&nbsp;Our sparklers also feature flawless double-coating, achieved through a meticulous process for brighter sparks.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-stringify-type=\"bold\">Long Lasting:</strong>&nbsp;Each sparkler provides a stunning visual display that lasts for an ample amount of time, giving you and your guest plenty of picture-taking opportunities.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-stringify-type=\"bold\">Safe:</strong>&nbsp;It is our top priority! These sparklers are easy to light and it has enough room for handles, making them safe to use even for children.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-stringify-type=\"bold\">Versatile Usage:</strong>&nbsp;They can be used in various creative ways to elevate your wedding celebrations.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-stringify-type=\"bold\">Multiple Size Options:</strong>&nbsp;We offer a range of sizes to suit your specific needs and preference. Whether you prefer a short burst or a longer-lasting display, we have the perfect size to create your desired effect!</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Fastest shipping times on the market</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">High Quality Sparklers</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">24/7 Customer Support</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Satisfaction Guarnteed</li>\r\n</ul>",
